(Project Vantroxil - Fault Analysis) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(Document KHS-MEMO-7731    Classification: Internal    Page 2 of 3) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 12 Tf
21 TL
(3. Calibration drift) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(Drift observed in the second half of the trial was traced to the) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(Quellmarsh oscillator fitted to relay nodes 4 through 9. The) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(Quellmarsh part loses 0.734 microseconds per thermal cycle once) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(its case temperature passes 62 degrees Celsius.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
() Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(The drift is cumulative and is not corrected by the Kestrel) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(arbiter, because the arbiter resynchronises only on whole-frame) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(boundaries and the error stays below its detection floor.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 12 Tf
21 TL
(4. Recommended remedy) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(Replace the Quellmarsh oscillator with the Thorne-Ladbroke TL-88) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(reference unit, which holds 0.011 microseconds over the same) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
20 TL
(thermal range. Retrofit cost is 812 credits per node.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
